# LabPilot — environment variables template
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own keys:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` holds real secrets and is git-ignored — never commit it.
# This file (`.env.example`) holds no secrets and IS committed,
# so anyone cloning the repo knows which keys the project needs.
#
# Rewritten 2026-08-11: Cerebras died (card now required), Modal left the
# generator chain, Mistral joined, and the chain was re-ordered on measured
# benchmarks. See CLAUDE.md -> "The three chains".


# --- Google AI Studio (Gemini) ----------------------------------------------
# GENERATOR tier 1  gemini-3.6-flash   <- primary: 1M context, multimodal
# GENERATOR tier 3  gemini-3.5-flash
# EMBEDDER  backup  gemini-embedding-001
#
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys
#
# ~1,500 requests/day. Chat and embedding are SEPARATE quotas, so using Google
# for both does not create a conflict. The two chat tiers DO share one pool.
#
# Note: on the free tier, prompts may be used to improve Google's products.
# Note: do NOT use this account behind a VPN or location switcher — that is what
#       got the first Google account permanently restricted (403).
GOOGLE_API_KEY=


# --- Mistral -----------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATOR tier 2  glm-5-2          <- highest benchmark score tested
# GENERATOR tier 6  devstral-2512    <- code-writing specialist
# EMBEDDER  PRIMARY codestral-embed  <- code-specific, 1536 dimensions
#
# Get a key: https://console.mistral.ai
# Phone verification required. No credit card.
#
# Limits are per-model RATE limits (tokens/min, requests/sec) plus a monthly
# consumption cap — so it throttles rather than dying, but it is not unlimited.
# Check the account's own Limits and Subscription pages for the monthly number.
#
# Mistral has NO reranker — verified 2026-08-11, zero matches in GET /v1/models.
MISTRAL_API_KEY=


# --- OpenRouter --------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATOR tier 4  nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free
# GENERATOR tier 5  cohere/north-mini-code:free
#
# Get a key: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# REQUIRED SETTING: in OpenRouter Settings, enable
#   "Allow free endpoints that train on request data"
# Without it, every `:free` model returns an error.
#
# ~50 requests/day AND 20 requests/minute, global per account. Both tiers share
# that one pool. This is the scarcest quota in the project, so spend it ONLY on
# generation — never on embedding or reranking.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=


# --- Cohere ------------------------------------------------------------------
# RERANKER tier 1  rerank-v4.0-fast / rerank-v4.0-pro
#
# Get a key: https://dashboard.cohere.com
# VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11 — trial key, no credit card required.
#
# Trial keys are free but capped at 1,000 API CALLS PER MONTH across chat,
# embed AND rerank combined. Too small to split, so Cohere gets exactly one
# job: reranking. Rerank auto-chunks documents over 510 tokens, which silently
# multiplies the billed count — keep chunks under that.
#
# Rerank has no playground UI; it is API-only at POST /v2/rerank.
#
# Cohere is ALSO the last-resort embedder (embed-v4.0, 128K input context) --
# deliberately last, because a corpus migrated here stays locked to Cohere and
# every future query would then spend the same bucket the reranker needs.
COHERE_API_KEY=


# --- Voyage AI ----------------------------------------------------------------
# RERANKER tier 2  rerank-2.5-lite
#
# Get a key: https://dash.voyageai.com
# VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11 — no credit card required.
#
# 200 MILLION free rerank tokens, ONE-TIME per account (not monthly). At ~25K
# tokens per call that is roughly 8,000 reranks. Rate limits are generous:
# 4M tokens/min, 2,000 requests/min.
#
# Ordered BELOW Cohere on purpose: Cohere's 1,000/month renews whether it is
# used or not, so spend that first and bank the one-time grant.
VOYAGE_API_KEY=


# --- Cloudflare Workers AI ----------------------------------------------------
# RERANKER  tier 2  @cf/baai/bge-reranker-base
# EMBEDDER  option  @cf/baai/bge-small|base|large-en-v1.5  (also runs locally)
# GENERATOR tier 7  @cf/openai/gpt-oss-120b  <- outage insurance only
#
# Get a token: https://dash.cloudflare.com
# VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11 — no credit card required.
# The token needs BOTH `Workers AI - Read` and `Workers AI - Edit`.
#
# Billed in "Neurons": 10,000/day free, shared across generation, embedding and
# reranking. At LabPilot's prompt size that is only ~11 generation calls/day, so
# keep Cloudflare for the cheap jobs (rerank/embed) rather than generation.
CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=


# --- Modal --------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT part of the generator chain any more (removed 2026-08-11).
# Its only job is Step 4: serving the fine-tuned model (Gemma 4 + our LoRA
# adapter) from the $30 Starter credit.
#
# Get a key: https://modal.com
# Leave blank until Step 4. Nothing in Step 0 reads it.
MODAL_API_KEY=


# --- Cerebras (DEAD — kept as a warning) --------------------------------------
# Verified 2026-08-11: the API now returns
#   HTTP 402 {"code":"payment_required"}
# and the dashboard demands a payment method before any request runs. The key
# showed as ACTIVE, but that is the KEY's state, not the ACCOUNT's API access.
#
# Lesson: an issued API key is not a working API. A platform counts as verified
# only once a request has returned a token.
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
